+| 21 | PlanningBoardController | PUT `/api/mes/planning-board/reschedule` | Reschedule | `mes-planning-board` | reschedule | 状态 | ドラッグ後 計画日時更新（PlanningBoardService.RescheduleAsync） |
+| 22 | PlanningBoardController | POST `/api/mes/planning-board/auto-arrange` | AutoArrange | `mes-planning-board` | arrange | 状态 | 自動配置（按 Prio+納期 批量重排计划） |
+| 23 | QualityInspectionController | POST `/api/mes/inspections` | Create | `mes-quality-inspection` | add | 否 | 品質検査 新規登録。菜单306。**注：menu-key 取菜单 RoutePath 域名 `quality-inspection`，非控制器路由 `inspections`（§六注3）** |
+| 24 | QualityInspectionController | PUT `/api/mes/inspections/{no}` | Update | `mes-quality-inspection` | edit | 否 | 検査訂正 |
+| 25 | PlanAchievementController | POST `/api/mes/plan-achievement/summary` | Summary | `mes-plan-achievement` | view | 只读POST→view | 达成率汇总，PlanAchievementService 全类无写（§四）。菜单313 |
+| 26 | PlanAchievementController | POST `/api/mes/plan-achievement/export-csv` | ExportCsv | `mes-plan-achievement` | view | 只读POST→view | 达成率 CSV 导出，纯读（§四） |
+| 27 | WorkCenterController | POST `/api/mes/work-center/upsert` | Upsert | `mes-work-center` | edit | 否 | 工作中心 master upsert（create+update 合一，§五归并4）。菜单314 |
+| 28 | WorkCenterController | DELETE `/api/mes/work-center/{wgCd}` | Delete | `mes-work-center` | del | 否 | 软删除 |
+| 29 | ProcessCostRateController | POST `/api/mes/process-cost-rate/upsert` | Upsert | `mes-process-cost-rate` | edit | **是** | **工序费率修正**（人工/间接费率）。retroactive 费率（ValidFrom 过去）直接改写**已报工工单的原価計算基础**→FIN 成本归集/结转重算（详§三，ProcessCostRateService.cs:27-62）。菜单315。简报点名「成本费率修正」 |
